  "Use when you want to look up, map, and search for short genetic variants (SNPs, indels) in NCBI's dbSNP database. Resolves between rsIDs, genomic coordinates in VCF format, and HGVS strings. For an rsID, returns variant type, gene associations, clinical significance, allele frequencies, and genomic coordinates (GRCh38).": "当想要在 NCBI dbSNP 数据库中查找、映射和搜索短基因组变异（SNPs、indels）时使用。支持 rsIDs、VCF 格式的基因组坐标和 HGVS 字符串之间互相解析。对于 rsID，它将返回变异类型、基因关联、临床意义、等位基因频率和基因组坐标（GRCh38）。",
